{
  "author": "KC桌面",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">KC桌面——外资精译</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">伯恩斯坦：东鹏饮料业务与季度数据观察</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">东鹏饮料交出了一份上市以来增速最慢的季度成绩单。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>在最新研报中记录，公司<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>收入同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11%</span>，低于市场预期的高个位数；其中能量饮料收入同比仅增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1%</span>，而此前该品类长期保持双位数增长。管理层在业绩会上将竞争加剧列为主要原因。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份报告的看点不在单季波动，而在公司应对方式。东鹏在相关市场上市仅数月、自由流通盘偏薄的情况下，宣布回购<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">10%</span> H股，并将中期分红率从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">55%</span>提升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">76%</span>，同时承诺<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span>前最低派息率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">80%</span>。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>认为，这些动作意在缓解市场对增长节奏变化的关注，但公司向“软饮料平台公司”转型的战略，可能在中长期持续影响利润率表现。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOX0JTrspRHiazCKHMRGJ5Jxq9wjCX1IUcVvnOAVdZaChkQgTJZ7GmUialMYaGB5CSjp1Tm8nxNr2DgPJ1veXibia2fuddOSqUYX0EA/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">消费行业数据与主题变化观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>能量饮料收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">45.25亿元</span>，同比仅增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.4%</span>，较<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>明显减速。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>指出，这是该品类从稳定双位数增长轨道上的一次显著偏离。与此同时，公司毛利率同比提升约400个基点至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">49.7%</span>，主因是原材料成本<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">低于预期</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">收入端节奏变化与利润端<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>同时出现，使得经营利润同比仍增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">14.4%</span>。但<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>提醒，成本红利是一次性的，而竞争不确定性是结构性的。管理层在业绩会上明确提到竞争加剧，这一表述在过往财报中并不常见。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">KC评论</span>：</strong> 毛利率提升掩盖了收入增长的实质问题。如果能量饮料增速持续在低个位数徘徊，成本红利消退后，利润端的支撑会很快减弱。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVKiaKKODEIN2ZoeeGq9QpUytRDMrWibSK8d9To7ACPXktibaibIiaBECm5JAWrQ6Ns5JwEUYKuI5A3j0H9a05Qicx8yDabz1wV0aliak/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">研究主题与行业变化观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">电解质水<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">10.26亿元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11.2%</span>，较一季度<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">13%</span>的增速继续回落。其他饮料板块收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9.91亿元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">97.3%</span>，其中即饮茶上半年收入弹性较高，但基数仍然较低。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">从收入结构看，能量饮料占比已从去年同期的约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">76%</span>降至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">69%</span>。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>认为，非能量业务毛利率比能量饮料低16至35个百分点，且目前规模尚小，短期内难以对整体利润率形成正向贡献。公司管理层强调的低糖无糖健康趋势创新，被<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>视为正面信号，但转化为利润仍需时间。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWKsPwm4etuxcJYdbaQkTzWQgUpFvnrDCkFANZiaLJ3GibibCicdx21Tibt1g7iaI8ndhIlfGwHr6qiamIKlaWY1qoc8k1uetsVT05204/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3.区域业务与近期数据观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">分区域看，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>中部收入同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">23%</span>，西部增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">19.8%</span>，北部增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9%</span>，而南部仅增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.8%</span>，东部几乎持平。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>的图表显示，多数区域增速环比节奏变化，中部是相对少见<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>的区域。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">经销商数量增长也在节奏变化。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>认为，<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">这意味着</span>渠道<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>驱动的增长模式正在接近阶段性平台期，未来增长更多依赖单点产出提升而非网点数量增加。</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">4.业务与近期数据观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">H股目标报价从138港元下调至131港元，维持Market-Perform评级。盈利预测方面，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY26</span>-28年EPS分别下调<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>、<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6%</span>、<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6%</span>。报告显示，东鹏相关市场当前交易在历史平均前瞻市盈率下方约1.6个标准差，相对基准指数的溢价也低于历史均值约1.7个标准差。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>的盈利预测较市场共识低<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2%</span>（收入）和4-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6%</span>（EPS），差异主要来自对能量饮料增速和费用投入的判断。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXFesLP7zabvGuYxc8bX4nsyba4jV8ricogYryBU8scYS8eyw1icPQskB3PQicLiauN2ML8chJZaln2ibWPmErPI36BmqibVocoIdLtc/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"KC Desk\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 06-Bernstein-Eastroc Beverage Group Co Ltd-9980.HK-Eastroc Q2- Out of Energy-260731</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见ΚСⅾеѕk․сοｍ</p>",
